        "comments": "The assembly sRajMon1.hap2.1 is based on 35x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial genome was assembled using MitoHiFi. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. The order and orientation of the scaffolds on the following chromosomes are uncertain: Chromosome 11 from 759 kp to 15.16, Chromosome 24 from 6.23 to 22.07, Chromosome 40 from 2.27 to 12.05, Chromosome 43 from 674 kb to 11.12 and Chromosome 44 from 3.95 Mbp to the end. Sex chromosome was assigned based on synteny to Raja brachyura (GCA_963514005.1).",
